,{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69284","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319982","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"21242","synopsis":"Yuu's late night meeting with Koyuki causes misunderstandings between him and Fuuka. Yuu's attempt to make up fails, and the mood remains awkward between them at work. Meanwhile their teacher, Tomomi, shows up at the beach house with the track team captain, Nachi, and reveals something unexpected.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ugjABAXWpA72mylPLbNWCDY9m2x.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Yuu's late night meeting with Koyuki causes misunderstandings between him and Fuuka. Yuu's attempt to make up fails, and the mood remains awkward between them at work. Meanwhile their teacher, Tomomi, shows up at the beach house with the track team captain, Nachi, and reveals something unexpected.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ugjABAXWpA72mylPLbNWCDY9m2x.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12300","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21887","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33743","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69284","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319982","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"21234","synopsis":"The new school term has begun, and Yuu's band has begun to practice in earnest, but bassist Yuu and vocalist/guitarist Fuuka are complete beginners. Nachi isn't much better as a drummer, and they attempt to recruit a senpai from their school, Sara Iwami, to take over on guitar. She's cold to them at first, but a revelation about Yuu brings her around.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rh51at3YxEzZJy7MqWHPGmxnum8.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"The new school term has begun, and Yuu's band has begun to practice in earnest, but bassist Yuu and vocalist/guitarist Fuuka are complete beginners. Nachi isn't much better as a drummer, and they attempt to recruit a senpai from their school, Sara Iwami, to take over on guitar. She's cold to them at first, but a revelation about Yuu brings her around.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rh51at3YxEzZJy7MqWHPGmxnum8.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12300","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21887","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33743","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69284","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319982","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"21241","synopsis":"Memories of childhood, parting, and regret cause Koyuki to make up her mind to face Yuu. She visits his home to give him concert tickets, but the two of them had no idea that this meeting would have immense consequences... On her way home, Koyuki runs into Fuuka, a huge fan of the singer, and the two end up at a public bathhouse together, much to Fuuka's delight.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vXQecfeGvKRAcD436rBGMz7zK1n.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Memories of childhood, parting, and regret cause Koyuki to make up her mind to face Yuu. She visits his home to give him concert tickets, but the two of them had no idea that this meeting would have immense consequences... On her way home, Koyuki runs into Fuuka, a huge fan of the singer, and the two end up at a public bathhouse together, much to Fuuka's delight.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vXQecfeGvKRAcD436rBGMz7zK1n.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12300","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21887","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33743","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69284","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319982","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"21236","synopsis":"A photo of Yuu and Koyuki taken outside his home spreads like wildfire on Twitter, creating a huge scandal for the popular singer. Even Yuu's account is found and targeted, and wild rumors are going around at school. The band's practices in preparation for the school fair had been coming along smoothly, but the rumors spoil Fuuka's mood. Meanwhile, Koyuki addresses the controversy on national television with a surprising declaration.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kLrNpkAkSZJFOVln6g8VGHeZS11.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"A photo of Yuu and Koyuki taken outside his home spreads like wildfire on Twitter, creating a huge scandal for the popular singer. Even Yuu's account is found and targeted, and wild rumors are going around at school. The band's practices in preparation for the school fair had been coming along smoothly, but the rumors spoil Fuuka's mood. Meanwhile, Koyuki addresses the controversy on national television with a surprising declaration.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kLrNpkAkSZJFOVln6g8VGHeZS11.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12300","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21887","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33743","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69284","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319982","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"21233","synopsis":"The day of the school fair has arrived. Fans enraged by Yuu and Koyuki's scandal crowd around and shout abuse as their band takes the stage. Yuu is certain that the power of Fuuka's singing can silence them, but chaos breaks loose. Koyuki, who had come to see Yuu's concert in secret, can't stand silently by any longer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uS2mjoEBwBaMWfhRJpkfSVxMTot.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"The day of the school fair has arrived. Fans enraged by Yuu and Koyuki's scandal crowd around and shout abuse as their band takes the stage. Yuu is certain that the power of Fuuka's singing can silence them, but chaos breaks loose. Koyuki, who had come to see Yuu's concert in secret, can't stand silently by any longer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uS2mjoEBwBaMWfhRJpkfSVxMTot.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12300","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21887","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33743","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69284","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319982","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"21239","synopsis":"For their first date, Yuu and Koyuki meet to visit a small town that she once visited when filming for a variety show. Meanwhile Yuu's band, The Fallen Moon, has been selected as an opening act for a gig at a live music club. Fuuka suggests they write an original song to play there, but a strange sense of confusion in her heart makes the process difficult.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/enogSHYtgIWi5x6DxtbJvj5qM4k.jpg","metadataSour